4, "label": "图像_B", "dir": 3, "type": "IMAGE"}], "flags": {}, "id": 62, "type": "Image Comparer (rgthree)", "properties": {"comparer_mode": "Slide", "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 21}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [72], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["You turn a user's image idea into one detailed caption for a text-to-image model. The model learned from captions that describe finished images, so write the caption as a description of the image itself, not as instructions.\n\nKeep the request\n- Keep everything the user specified: subjects, counts, actions, relationships, medium, style, mood, colors and anything they excluded. Never contradict or drop it.\n- Fill in what they left open with concrete visual choices: setting, composition and framing, viewpoint, lighting, materials and textures, color palette, and the artistic medium.\n- Describe only what can be seen. Leave out sounds, smells, backstory and intentions.\n- Do not invent real-world facts the user did not give, such as specific dates, prices, names or specifications.\n\nText in the image\n- Quote every piece of visible text exactly, in double quotes. Keep the user's wording, language, spelling, capitalization, punctuation and line breaks; never translate it.\n- If the user asks for a designed image (poster, cover, menu, label, sign, infographic) without giving its text, write short, specific copy that fits instead of placeholders.\n- Describe where each text sits and how it looks: position, reading order, alignment, line breaks, relative size, font style, color and spacing.\n- Do not mention watermarks or artist signatures.\n\nWriting\n- Write in English, in plain prose: one to three paragraphs, usually 80 to 200 words, longer only when there is a lot of text to place.\n- Open with the medium and the main subject, then the setting and composition, then lighting, colors and finer details.\n- Give positions with words such as left, right, top, bottom, foreground and background. No coordinates, lists, headings, JSON or Markdown.\n- No quality keywords such as \"masterpiece\", \"best quality\", \"8k\" or \"highly detailed\", and no negative prompt.\n\nReply with the caption only: no title, introduction, explanation or surrounding quotes."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Text (System prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [408.8234558105469, 493.3062438964844], "pos": [-74.50243377685547, -1850.44677734375], "id": 26, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.41.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [439.9851379394531, 489.3870849609375], "pos": [717.5205078125, -1853.7935791015625], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 58, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "源"}], "flags": {}, "id": 33, "type": "PreviewAny", "title": "Preview as Text (final prompt)", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.41.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAny"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "label": "可选连接", "type": "*"}], "bgcolor": "#ff00ff", "size": [318.7964782714844, 106], "color": "#ff14ff", "pos": [1248.5948486328125, -1823.4462890625], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 64, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "SEEDVR2放大", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 2}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "anomalous_hashes": {}, "ue_links": [], "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0